msgstr ""
"**DORA ／ Accelerate** {cite}`forsgren2018accelerate` —— 支撑 30/60/90 "
"这一框架的节奏与度量谱系。"

#: ../../source/chapters/12-where-we-go-from-here.md:239
#: 71a0d1b3dfa244b68e212e1ba4ec32f3
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Lehman's laws** {cite}`lehman1980laws` — why the 90-day review must recur."
msgstr "**Lehman 定律** {cite}`lehman1980laws` —— 为什么 90 天评审必须周而复始。"

#: ../../source/chapters/12-where-we-go-from-here.md:241
